\ xsign.fam — XMSS keys and signing (docs/GUI_WALLET.md, phase 1), after
\ xmss.fam (and so arith.fam, poseidon2.fam and state.fam's le@ and dle).
\ As tabminer's miner/src/xmss.rs SecretKey: a key made from a 32-byte
\ seed (generate_with_height; an output's key is made from the seed
\ H(master, nonce), miner/src/wallet.rs's key), its whole tree kept; its
\ public key and its signatures byte for byte as tabminer's to_bytes.
\
\ Leaves are the caller's to keep.  XMSS is stateful: two signatures at one
\ leaf give the key away.  The caller must record a leaf as used (durably,
\ where the key's state is kept) before a signature made at it leaves the
\ program; xksign signs at whatever leaf it is given.
\
\ A key's record (Montgomery words): its height; the secret seed (8); the
\ public seed (4); the tree in heap order (position 1 the root, leaf i at
\ 2^h + i), 2^(h+1) digests of 8.
\
\ xkinit ( -- )  the buffers (and p2init, xinit, if not yet).
\ xksize ( h -- n )  a record's bytes at height h (1 to 20).
\ xkgen ( seed h k -- )  the key of the 32 bytes at seed, height h, made at
\ k (xksize bytes): 1,139 permutations a leaf (18,239 at height 4: about
\ 2.3 s under QEMU).
\ xkpub ( k dst -- )  its public key at dst: 49 bytes (as xverify takes).
\ xksign ( k msg n leaf dst -- )  dst (8 + (68 + h) 32 bytes) = the
\ signature of the n Montgomery words at msg (n at most 256) at the leaf
\ (below 2^h): about 570 permutations (about 90 ms under QEMU).

: xkk variable ;  : xkh variable ;  : xkl variable ;  : xkc variable ;  : xko variable ;
: xkm variable ;  : xkn variable ;  : xkb variable ;  : xks variable ;

: xkinit  p2init xsd @ 0= if xinit then  xkb @ 0= if 440 lit alloc xkb ! then ;
: xksize  1 lit swap 1 lit + lshift 5 lit lshift 34 lit + ;
: xknode  5 lit lshift xkk @ 34 lit + + ;     \ ( pos -- a )  the tree's digest at pos

\ xkw ( x dst -- dst' )  x, 4 bytes little-endian.
: xkw  4 lit 0 lit do over i 3 lit lshift rshift over i + c! loop 4 lit + nip ;
\ xkput ( a dst n -- dst' )  the n Montgomery words at a, canonical bytes.
: xkput  0 lit do over i w@ fromm swap xkw loop nip ;

\ xkfps ( seed -- )  xkb (11 words) = the 32 bytes three to a word, little-
\ endian (tabminer's bytes_to_fps), Montgomery.
: xkfps
B lit 0 lit do
	0 lit
	3 lit 0 lit do
		j 3 lit * i + dup 20 lit u< if 2 lit pick + c@ i 3 lit lshift lshift or else drop then
	loop
	tom xkb @ i w!
loop drop ;

\ xkleaf ( i -- )  leaf i's WOTS+ public key, at its place in the tree:
\ each chain from its start (the secret seed's PRF) to its end.
: xkleaf
xix !
43 lit 0 lit do
	i xkc !  xends @ i 5 lit lshift + xko !
	1 lit xix @ 0 lit xkc @ thcap  xkk @ 4 lit + 8 lit xko @ thabs
	F lit 0 lit do xko @ xkc @ i 10 lit lshift or xstep loop
loop
3 lit xix @ 0 lit 0 lit thcap  xends @ 218 lit  1 lit xkh @ lshift xix @ + xknode  thabs ;

: xkgen
xkk ! xkh !  xkh @ xkk @ !
xkfps
\ the seeds: the secret one, then the public one (the first four words)
xsd @ 4 lit wzero
7 lit 0 lit 0 lit 0 lit thcap  xkb @ B lit xkk @ 4 lit + thabs
7 lit 1 lit 0 lit 0 lit thcap  xkb @ B lit xmd @ thabs
xmd @ xkk @ 24 lit + 4 lit wcopy
xkk @ 24 lit + xsd @ 4 lit wcopy
1 lit xkh @ lshift 0 lit do i xkleaf loop
\ the levels above, to the root
xkh @ 1 lit + 1 lit do
	1 lit xkh @ i - lshift xks !  i xkl !
	xks @ 0 lit do
		4 lit i xkh @ xkl @ thcap
		xks @ i + dup 1 lit lshift xknode 10 lit rot xknode thabs
	loop
loop ;

: xkpub
swap xkk !
xkk @ 54 lit + swap 8 lit xkput
xkk @ 24 lit + swap 4 lit xkput
xkk @ @ swap c! ;

: xksign
xko ! xkl ! xkn ! xkm ! xkk !  xkk @ @ xkh !
xkk @ 24 lit + xsd @ 4 lit wcopy  xkl @ xix !
\ the leaf's index (8 bytes), the randomizer
xkl @ xko @ xkw  0 lit swap xkw xko !
6 lit xkl @ 0 lit 0 lit thcap  xkk @ 4 lit + 8 lit xkb @ thabs
xkb @ xko @ 8 lit xkput xko !
\ the message's digest: the randomizer, the count, the words
xkn @ tom xkb @ 8 lit w!
xkn @ ?dup if xkm @ xkb @ 24 lit + rot wcopy then
5 lit xkl @ 0 lit 0 lit thcap  xkb @ xkn @ 9 lit + xmd @ thabs
xdigits
\ each chain's value: its start run to its digit
43 lit 0 lit do
	i xkc !
	1 lit xkl @ 0 lit xkc @ thcap  xkk @ 4 lit + 8 lit xkb @ thabs
	xd @ i + c@ ?dup if 0 lit do xkb @ xkc @ i 10 lit lshift or xstep loop then
	xkb @ xko @ 8 lit xkput xko !
loop
\ the path: each level's sibling
1 lit xkh @ lshift xkl @ +
xkh @ 0 lit do dup 1 lit xor xknode xko @ 8 lit xkput xko !  1 lit rshift loop drop ;
